WEBVTT

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:19.690
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Fighting.</i>

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:26.920
<i>What did you want?</i>

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:43.110
<i>THE KING'S AVATAR
FOR THE GLORY</i>

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:53.500
<i>Esports is officially recognized as the 78th sport of our country.</i>

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:57.400
<i>This July, for the first time ever, 
 Glory hosts its professional league!</i>

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.670
<i>A myriad number of Glory gamers 
 will soon finish their job change</i>

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:08.140
<i>To become professional Esports players!</i>

00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:13.400
<i>But if one wants to become a champion,</i>

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:18.290
<i>Not only do you need personal strength, 
 but also the team spirit.</i>

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:26.750
Captain Lü Liang, what's the reason for 
 your sudden repatriate and team switch?

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.500
Royal style is the top club in our country,

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:31.780
And their official lineup have talented players.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.400
I want to be here,

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.490
And be the first champion of Glory in this country.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:38.990
Wow, this man is strong.

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:42.060
The foreign champion of the Starfaring league.

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:45.550
A superstar Esports player.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:50.550
Hey, Ye Qiu,
 Superstar Esports player!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:53.930
Yea, I know.

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:57.520
Desert Dust dropped his fist weapons from the PK 
 Do you want it or not?

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.070
Ey, give me that!

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.990
You don't see this everyday.
 I'll take it apart and analyse it.

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:04.800
Su Muqiu,
 For your study of silver weapons,

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.570
You took so much apart that you looked like an exhibitionist.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:12.000
The system of self created weapons. 
 Isn't that the most interesting part of this game?

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:19.030
It's common knowledge: 
 Not every player made weapon can be the best,

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:23.490
But the best weapon
 must be one that a player made.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.610
Then the Evil Annihilation that you made for me, 
 is it the best one?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.820
Not yet it's not.
 But very soon it will be.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.850
Until you
 prove that it is the best weapon.

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:37.110
Oi,

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:39.880
Thinking about going pro?

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.030
What are you two mumbling about
 while not clocked out?

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.380
Ye Qiu, computer #2 is freezing.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.330
Take a look.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.810
Su Muqiu,
 customer on #5 is asking for a cola.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:51.300
Finish this and you're done work.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:52.940
On it, boss!

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:06.450
Wait where is my notepad?

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.790
You forgotton it in the netcafe.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.560
Oh come on,
 You saw it and didn't tell me?

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:15.060
Sigh, I'll get it later.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.840
Oh right, Emotionless Magic keep bothering me to make a team.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:20.410
Ye Qiu,

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.880
Let's fight in the pro league.

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:26.570
I...

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:31.050
Big bro, Ye Qiu,
 you're off work!

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.620
I left food on the table.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:37.280
Study well and don't be late.
 Ok, you guys rest early.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.510
Ok!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.510
I'm off!
 Be careful on the way there!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.860
Mucheng bought me my favorite
 Waffle fries.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:56.160
That brat.
 She's taking your side more often now.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:58.700
Hm, Delicious.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.010
Are you still not done reading Esport news?

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.250
Playing in the league would let me fight 
 the best players in the world...

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:06.330
Even if I'm dreaming, I want to stand there

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:09.890
And touch that 24 carat gold trophy!

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:15.430
Food's getting cold.

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.210
Oh...

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:25.310
To be a professional, what you sacrifice
 Will be much more than what you imagene.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:27.350
A lot of things holding you back.

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:31.670
What, you saying you don't think about touching that trophy?

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:35.360
I think about it,

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:38.540
But I can't reveal myself to everyone.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:40.530
My family will force me back home.

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:44.270
If you want it, 
 why don't you take this step?

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:47.970
Because...

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:50.700
Family is family.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.320
I want their approval.

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:55.310
Approval?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:01.780
Maybe, 
 When we're champions,

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:06.000
They will look at Esports differently
 And not thinking it is just a game!

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.180
If I could help you out, I...

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:21.450
No, not for me.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.750
But for yourself.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:47.110
Ye Qiu, Su Muqiu,
 Come to Line Canyon!

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.420
Someone is killstealing my boss!

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:52.740
Call Emotionless Magic and the others.

00:07:53.010 --> 00:07:54.890
Yeah, and bring Evil Annihilation too.

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:57.000
Sure, good chance to get a better feel for it.

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:14.270
The boss in position!

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.430
Brother Tao,
 I brought a new comrade.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:22.420
Qi Master,
 Named Qi Breaker.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:23.570
Hello, chef.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:26.110
If you're Ye Qiu's friend
 Surely you must be strong.

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:29.040
The situation is.
 Cliff Ronin Alpine respawned,

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:31.720
We got it down to half,
 Royal Style came in and took it away.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:34.620
Our brothers can't just take this.
 We'll get our revenge!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.740
Take back the boss,
 Get all the drops and eliminate Royal Style!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.850
Ye Qiu, you lead.

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:41.600
Everyone follow your command.
- OK.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.550
They only got the numbers,

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:46.190
Only their commanding exorcist
 Have some combat awareness.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:53.390
Focus fire!
 Boss going to red!

00:08:53.870 --> 00:08:57.460
Qi Breaker, separate their commanding exorcist from the main force

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.400
Autumn Tree(Su Muqiu) and I will finish him.

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:02.320
Emotionless Magic, cut their escape routes.

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:03.970
The boss will kill them for us.

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:05.220
Leave it to me!

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:07.390
Spring Heaven,
 assist Qi Breaker

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.230
Take out any survivors.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.020
As for Woven Shadows,

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.570
Save teammate from death of course.
- You follow brother Tao.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:16.430
Everyone, finish off Royal Style first
 then comes the boss.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:17.510
Start!

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:21.240
The boss is entering berserk stage!

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:24.320
Go!

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:26.540
Steady now.
 Boss berserked!

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:35.910
Excuse me.

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:42.720
<i>One Autumn Leaf!</i>

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:52.660
Not bad using the Evil Annihilation.

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:12.450
This is bad!
 The road is blocked!

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:13.890
- Retreat!
- Retreat!

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:24.210
Don't be afraid !
 she's by herself.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:25.940
Die!

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:35.910
<i>No thoroughfare.</i>

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:38.490
You live up to your name One Autumn Leaf.
 very impressive.

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:41.230
Admit defeat.
 The boss is ours.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:44.010
It is too early to tell,
 isn't it?

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:45.280
Pro is persistent.

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.720
No matter how persistent, I'll make him kneel.

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:50.240
This time I'll activate the 7th stage
 of Battle Spirit.

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:52.730
Eh? 7th stage!?
 That passive asks for 120 hit combo.

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:53.840
Can you even do that?

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:01.580
I got you,
 and the weapon you made for me.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.380
You tell me if I can.

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:07.650
You can!
 You're not by yourself.

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:33.550
Want to activate Battle Spirit?

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:37.690
Dream on!

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:52.010
Oops, unfortunately.

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:54.000
We almost succeeded.

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:58.190
I'll owe you a Battle Spirit.
 I'll give it to you next time.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:00.890
We've still got to finish the boss.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.450
Come on, let's return.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:12.400
We're coming!

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:26.070
<i>One Autumn Leaf...</i>

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.180
<i>Full offensive team.</i>

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:35.570
This guy's not bad.

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:39.620
He separated you and your team
 Using the boss to pin your teammates.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.180
While practicing Battle Spirit on the side.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.140
- Lu Captain .
- But this is just the normal game.

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:49.660
In the real match,
 He's got no chance.

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:53.620
Couldn't part with it?

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.440
It is like a part of me...

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:03.550
But it suits you better.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:08.540
It is now also a part of me.

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:10.030
Let's fight together.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.090
Yeah.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:12.510
For Glory.

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:25.700
Big bro.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:28.330
Let's go.
 Ye Qiu is waiting for us at the park.

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:29.670
Ok!

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:34.790
Big bro!

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:36.880
Little brat, what are you doing?

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:39.980
I want to see you become champion!

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:42.660
Sure, it is a promise!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.340
You will surely see it.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:46.640
Ok!
 I'll watch every match!

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:50.170
- Careful, don't let it affect studying!
- Ok.

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:51.650
Are you ready?

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.910
- I prepared a present for you!
- What present? Tell me!

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:56.600
It is a secret!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.200
Surprised to see me?

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:20.570
How was your videogame playing?

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.510
I'm going to become pro
 And enter the tournament.

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:25.880
Playing videogames?

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.220
- Two?
- Just one.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.000
Basketball and soccer are sports.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.640
And so is Esports.

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:36.870
Why is it in your eyes
 it is only playing videogames?

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:40.140
You saying it like this...
 Is everything just to prove a point?

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.410
No, it is my dream to be a pro.

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:44.730
Here, a sibling stick.

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:46.960
It's not called that is it?

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:53.390
In truth, mom and dad
 wanted me to check on you.

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:56.430
If you become pro,
 Do you think they will approve?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:58.560
Nope.

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:02.420
We're like kites,

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:05.520
The strings are always
 in the hand of our parents.

00:15:05.890 --> 00:15:07.180
Yes, Like kites.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:10.840
But the people hold the strings,
 To make the kite become sturdy and fly higher.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.710
Then do what you want.
 I'll hold down the fort.

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:25.360
If you don't want to be seen...

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:35.530
It's late.
 Go home.

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:39.360
Don't need you to tell me.
 I'm off.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:45.370
Which one is the older brother?

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.220
Whoever is stronger is the older brother.

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:51.030
But you're not strong,
 And you're my older bro.

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:53.150
I'm not strong? I'm not strong!?

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:54.850
Don't you start detesting me now.

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:57.070
I detest!

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:04.950
I'm hungry.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:08.480
When we return home
 I'll make you some tomato fried rice.

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.490
Destination: the supermarket!

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:13.200
Haven't eaten that in a long time.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.410
If back then
 I didn't lose to you,

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:17.680
There was no way you will sample Mucheng's dish.

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:22.400
Back then...

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.800
Back then,
 I was one of the best in Glory.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.660
Who could've imagined. 
 Someone came that bested me?

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:36.250
<i>What a rare sight, Su Muqiu
 finally found someone who can compete with him.</i>

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:47.560
<i>Su Muqiu, not your day today.</i>

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.260
<i>Su Muqiu, your sister is here.</i>

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:54.760
<i>Eh are you hungry.
 and couldn't use your full strength.</i>

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:00.550
<i>Want to eat then continue?</i>

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:03.830
<i>Come.
 You eat too.</i>

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:07.610
<i>So that when you lose,
 you don't give me any excuses.</i>

00:17:08.970 --> 00:17:11.200
<i>If you got nowhere to go,
 Then stay at my place.</i>

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:12.440
<i>Not good.</i>

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:14.470
<i>It's only me and Mucheng living here.</i>

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:16.630
<i>It will feel less empty if you stay.</i>

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:20.070
<i>Not good.</i>

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:21.750
<i>I'm working at Excellent Era netcafe.</i>

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:24.240
<i>The boss is recruiting.
 You can come with.</i>

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:26.070
<i>Not good...</i>

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.910
<i>Where do you think is not good?</i>

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:31.690
<i>Of course not good
 why are you stripping me!</i>

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:34.850
<i>It is soiled.
 How am I to wash it then?</i>

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:37.870
<i>« Not good... »</i>

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:40.240
<i>Food's ready!</i>

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:42.810
<i>I'm here!</i>

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:45.150
<i>You made tomato fried rice again!</i>

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.990
<i>Did you wash your hands?
 You can only eat after.</i>

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:53.440
How the time flies.

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:56.070
We played Glory together for two years.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:59.920
Didn't you say before
 You can go for another ten?

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:03.990
It's just that without a goal
 ten is not doable.

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:05.940
I have my goals.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:07.460
You?

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.270
Glory finally have a pro league.

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:12.020
Let's start our team.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.460
Destination, Champions!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:46.650
<i>Esport as a new form of competition,</i>

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:49.020
<i>It is progressing fast internationally.</i>

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:52.070
<i>Many teams composed of professional players
 Fighting with everything they got on this stage.</i>

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:56.860
<i>Now, with the beginning of the first tournament league.</i>

00:18:57.350 --> 00:19:01.650
<i>This is the stage
 for one's dreams to be realized!</i>

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:15.350
<i>It's said all the veteran clubs
 are preparing and organizing.</i>

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:17.060
<i>Training programs and Official teams for Glory.</i>

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:20.860
<i>We hope we can see on this stage
 The ascension of a new king!</i>

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:25.410
<i>To all our viewers in front of the screen,</i>

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:26.900
<i>are you ready?</i>

00:19:29.630 --> 00:19:31.900
- Leveling up complete!
- Let me see.

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:39.060
This should be the game's best weapon right now.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.740
Should let you get ahead of the competition, no?

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:45.200
<i>Excellent Era netcafe</i>

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:49.200
To build the team we need funds.
 And the process seems complicated.

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.320
And the equipment, the staff for the training ground...

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:54.450
Not something we can easily do.

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:58.350
The registration process, training ground and funding
 I already prepared them.

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:00.450
I've been thinking of making this team for a while now.

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:02.920
Brother Tao, you...

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:05.030
I guarantee you it is the best you can get.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:07.200
Just focus on your training.

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:09.620
Leave the rest to me.

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.420
You got the list of team members?

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:17.850
Our last team at Line Canyon had a clean fight.

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:20.410
Yeah, and they won cleanly.

00:20:21.270 --> 00:20:23.540
It was the correct choice,
 calling them for help.

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:27.110
I already invited them.
 They are all excited for it.

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:30.390
Oh right Brother Tao,
 what's the name of our team?

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.500
Our team name shall be Excellent Era.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.750
Team Excellent Era?

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:38.220
It sounds like a roadside netcafe.

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:40.440
Don't say it like that! 
 Way too direct!

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.160
To the left.

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:46.620
Nope, still crooked.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.030
Go up a bit.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:51.030
Too much,
 go down.

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.240
Is it still crooked?

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:55.760
Let me help.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:59.180
Yes, it is straight now.

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.080
Stop there bro, Ye Qiu.

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.200
Hold still.

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:08.750
We finally become pros.

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:13.060
Through all that hard work,
 this day has come.

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:15.360
Advance to the summit, youngsters!

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:19.390
We are only getting started.

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:22.410
But we will be at the summit. 
 yeah.

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:28.750
<i>According to our weather network,</i>

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:31.110
<i>Typhoon Canhong
 will hit us today.</i>

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:34.150
<i>Hangzhou will face two to three days of heavy storm.</i>

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.890
<i>Every citizen should pay attention to their safety.</i>

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:40.970
Dancing Rain?

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:42.530
You planning on playing Launcher?

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:45.010
She looks like your sister.

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:48.220
It is a surprise present for her.

00:21:53.470 --> 00:21:55.990
What heavy rain.
 Will they be able to come?

00:21:56.190 --> 00:21:58.170
Heyo!
 It's me Emotionless Magic!

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:00.280
The one who had that great run!

00:22:02.430 --> 00:22:05.590
This is Woven Shadows, our Cleric!

00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:07.920
I found him infront of your door.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:10.490
Where he put in good thoughts for this meeting,

00:22:10.610 --> 00:22:12.610
And asked me to help him with his wet cloths.

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:14.110
Come, our clerc.

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:16.570
We may have took a bit of time.

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:20.160
It's actually because he suddenly hugged me,
 that I got splashed with the umbrella.

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:21.360
Just great.

00:22:27.310 --> 00:22:28.910
Hello, I am Spring Heaven.

00:22:29.300 --> 00:22:31.110
What? You're Brother Spring?

00:22:31.570 --> 00:22:33.880
You play like a brute, 
 and you don't speak with microphone,

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:35.490
I thought you were a man playing!

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:39.700
You're a beauty,
 that's why you don't speak.

00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:41.380
I don't speak needlessly.

00:22:42.480 --> 00:22:45.400
Beauties always need to watch out for themselves.
 They can't act like you.

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:49.110
Everyone take a quick break.
 I'll prepare the contracts.

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:54.780
Wow, everyone is here.

00:22:57.390 --> 00:22:59.450
I am Qi Breaker,
 Wu Xuefeng.

00:23:00.650 --> 00:23:01.860
One Autumn Leaf.

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:06.410
All accounted for.
 Let's start the signing.

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:09.690
Lend me your IDs.
 I'll make a photocopy.

00:23:13.420 --> 00:23:14.300
Shoot.

00:23:14.630 --> 00:23:16.390
I misplaced it with my account card.

00:23:16.550 --> 00:23:18.420
I'll go home, 
 be back soon.

00:23:19.840 --> 00:23:21.610
Eh?
 It is raining cats and dogs outside.

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:26.120
No problem. Just wait for me.

00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:49.930
Be good.
 One for the brother and one for the sister.

00:23:51.840 --> 00:23:52.790
Delicious.

00:24:20.580 --> 00:24:22.820
Brother Tao,
 I'll call Su Muqiu.

00:25:02.560 --> 00:25:06.300
<i>The typhoon Canhong is coming to
 Hangzhou at a speed of 20 km/h</i>

00:25:06.490 --> 00:25:08.700
<i>Moving north-west.</i>

00:25:09.200 --> 00:25:13.820
<i>It will pass Hangzhou during the night 
 and continue moving north-east.</i>

00:25:36.980 --> 00:25:37.830
Su Muqiu.

00:25:38.840 --> 00:25:39.830
Su Muqiu !

00:25:42.520 --> 00:25:43.630
Su Muqiu...

00:25:48.060 --> 00:25:52.740
<i>Here lies, dear brother Su Muqiu.</i>

00:26:31.890 --> 00:26:32.740
<i>Ye Qiu.</i>

00:26:32.860 --> 00:26:34.740
<i>Ye Qiu,
 I want to tell you.</i>

00:26:35.810 --> 00:26:38.970
<i>My brother always wanted to become an Esports player.</i>

00:26:39.410 --> 00:26:41.820
<i>He keeps on telling me,</i>

00:26:42.050 --> 00:26:45.440
<i>That one day he will stand on the podium.</i>

00:26:46.760 --> 00:26:47.840
<i>I'm off!</i>

00:27:02.910 --> 00:27:04.890
<i>Take care of Mucheng.
 I'll be back soon.</i>

00:27:05.010 --> 00:27:06.360
<i>Hun? Me?</i>

00:27:06.640 --> 00:27:07.450
<i>Of course.</i>

00:27:07.760 --> 00:27:09.170
<i>She is your family too.</i>

00:27:10.070 --> 00:27:11.500
<i>Take care of her for me.</i>

00:27:12.870 --> 00:27:14.170
<i>Brother!</i>

00:27:25.930 --> 00:27:28.110
The team now only have five players.

00:27:29.090 --> 00:27:32.260
If it doesn't satisfy the requirements of six,

00:27:33.010 --> 00:27:33.940
Excellent Era...

00:27:34.590 --> 00:27:36.680
Will be unable to register as a team.

00:27:39.870 --> 00:27:42.730
I understand, it is not the time to say this.

00:27:43.220 --> 00:27:44.830
And I respect your choices.

00:27:45.910 --> 00:27:47.490
All the contracts are here.

00:27:47.990 --> 00:27:49.490
To go or to stay,

00:27:49.770 --> 00:27:51.990
It will depend on your courage and determination.

00:27:53.060 --> 00:27:54.900
- I feel...
- It is just one person.

00:27:55.420 --> 00:27:57.050
I'm already 23.

00:27:57.270 --> 00:27:59.040
I quit my job and flew here.

00:27:59.160 --> 00:28:01.320
Then I'm told the team is not happening?!
 This a joke?

00:28:02.650 --> 00:28:04.410
- Mucheng, you...
- Uncle Tao Xuan,

00:28:04.950 --> 00:28:08.740
I'm picking up my bro's belongings.

00:28:30.200 --> 00:28:31.110
Mucheng...

00:28:38.840 --> 00:28:42.730
To compete in the league was my bro's dream.

00:28:45.140 --> 00:28:47.070
You should all try your best.

00:28:48.340 --> 00:28:51.090
If you're missing a person,
 then you must find a replacement.

00:28:51.870 --> 00:28:53.470
- Work hard.
- Mucheng !

00:28:53.700 --> 00:28:54.660
Captain Ye,

00:28:55.550 --> 00:28:56.780
Let me go to her.

00:28:57.470 --> 00:28:58.590
I've made up my mind.

00:28:58.800 --> 00:29:00.100
No matter what happens,

00:29:00.740 --> 00:29:02.380
I will stay for the league.

00:29:10.910 --> 00:29:11.840
Sorry.

00:29:12.050 --> 00:29:14.060
I didn't realize that
 Mucheng was hearing this.

00:29:14.280 --> 00:29:15.050
I...

00:29:16.740 --> 00:29:18.680
We understand what you mean.

00:29:18.870 --> 00:29:21.300
We will also stay,
 and face this together.

00:29:22.940 --> 00:29:24.070
I'm staying too.

00:29:25.150 --> 00:29:26.750
Our team doesn't have its sixth member.

00:29:26.870 --> 00:29:28.760
So the first priority is to get that person.

00:29:30.340 --> 00:29:32.710
We'll lower the expectations for teamwork.

00:29:33.380 --> 00:29:36.160
And slowly train that up during the season.

00:29:40.080 --> 00:29:42.810
Mucheng, how about I walk you home?

00:29:43.500 --> 00:29:46.250
Sister, I'll be fine by myself.

00:29:46.630 --> 00:29:48.420
When my big bro was here,

00:29:48.660 --> 00:29:50.890
I walked home alone,.

00:29:51.100 --> 00:29:53.970
and ate alone and did my homework alone.

00:29:54.290 --> 00:29:55.530
I'm not afraid.

00:30:22.480 --> 00:30:24.450
Let us hurry, on finding our sixth.

00:30:35.160 --> 00:30:37.540
How about joining team Excellent Era?

00:30:38.050 --> 00:30:40.820
Sorry, I already accepted an invitation from another team.

00:31:02.060 --> 00:31:03.830
<i>Days until last registration date : 0</i>

00:31:03.950 --> 00:31:04.990
Rejected again.

00:31:05.230 --> 00:31:06.750
It is hard to find a player.

00:31:06.950 --> 00:31:09.900
It's not hard to find a player,
 but it sure is hard finding an expert!

00:31:10.080 --> 00:31:12.400
Everyone gunning for the championship already has a team.

00:31:12.640 --> 00:31:14.350
If worse comes to worst, I'll participate.

00:31:14.780 --> 00:31:17.470
Brother Tao, we're trying to find an expert!

00:31:17.840 --> 00:31:20.620
- What does Ye Qiu think?
- Brother Tao, calm down.

00:31:20.910 --> 00:31:22.260
He should have a plan.

00:31:23.410 --> 00:31:27.900
Captain Ye posted a notice, 
 taking on challengers in the netcafe.

00:31:29.120 --> 00:31:30.920
A notice?

00:31:31.200 --> 00:31:33.080
I thought he hated exposure!

00:31:35.390 --> 00:31:39.290
Wait, is he being a turncoat?

00:31:41.400 --> 00:31:43.290
Su Muqiu is not here anymore.

00:31:43.410 --> 00:31:45.240
This place only have sad memories for him...

00:31:45.360 --> 00:31:47.290
Turn what? Coat what?

00:31:48.640 --> 00:31:50.780
I'll turn myself in.

00:31:50.990 --> 00:31:54.600
Boss, someone named dark something is challenging us.

00:31:54.810 --> 00:31:56.150
He built up a win streak,

00:31:56.270 --> 00:31:58.070
And now he is fighting brother Ye!

00:31:58.270 --> 00:31:59.700
Is he called Total Darkness?

00:32:00.400 --> 00:32:02.500
Wait! That's right it is Total Darkness!

00:32:02.700 --> 00:32:04.380
He's fighting Ye Qiu !

00:32:06.640 --> 00:32:11.410
<i>Excellent Era netcafe</i>

00:32:30.100 --> 00:32:32.300
Don't forget about our bet.

00:32:34.080 --> 00:32:36.080
I keep my promises!
 But I...

00:32:36.310 --> 00:32:39.120
You been losing to me the whole day.
 Have some chocolate.

00:32:40.400 --> 00:32:42.200
Be full, get some strength back.

00:32:46.480 --> 00:32:48.590
I will beat you one day!

00:32:49.260 --> 00:32:52.240
<i>Total Darkness</i>

00:33:01.880 --> 00:33:03.170
You're back.

00:33:03.450 --> 00:33:04.510
Let me help.

00:33:04.810 --> 00:33:06.970
You're up?
 Let's have breakfast.

00:33:09.700 --> 00:33:12.210
I went and bought the daily necessities.

00:33:12.500 --> 00:33:13.970
Help me organize them later.

00:33:15.120 --> 00:33:16.880
Oh and I finished washing the clothes.

00:33:19.180 --> 00:33:21.970
Muqiu went out of his way and made this character for you.

00:33:22.370 --> 00:33:23.440
Dancing Rain.

00:33:23.950 --> 00:33:26.940
I thought about it for a long time,
 and decided to entrust you with it.

00:33:28.060 --> 00:33:28.840
Ye Qiu,

00:33:29.250 --> 00:33:30.090
Thanks.

00:33:36.370 --> 00:33:39.070
<i>To all our viewers,
 welcome to the pro league.</i>

00:33:39.190 --> 00:33:41.070
<i>The first match
 of season one.</i>

00:33:41.300 --> 00:33:43.690
<i>I am Pan Lin, your commentator.</i>

00:33:46.210 --> 00:33:49.290
<i>Tonight, at the Xiaoshan stadium 
 team Excellent Era</i>

00:33:49.410 --> 00:33:51.050
<i>will be facing the visitor team Blue Rain.</i>

00:33:51.170 --> 00:33:53.320
<i>For these two teams,
 this is their debut.</i>

00:33:53.440 --> 00:33:54.910
<i>One Autumn Leaf! Glory's Number One!</i>

00:33:55.120 --> 00:33:57.860
<i>The match will consist of three rounds.
 The first: individual duels.</i>

00:33:58.060 --> 00:34:00.560
<i>Three players from each team
 will fight one on one.</i>

00:34:13.130 --> 00:34:14.770
<i>The second round will be an arena match.</i>

00:34:14.890 --> 00:34:17.400
<i>Each team will send out three players
 to battle three on three.</i>

00:34:17.520 --> 00:34:20.590
<i>Players who died will be eliminated.</i>

00:34:20.890 --> 00:34:24.530
<i>The side alive in the end will be victorious.</i>

00:34:30.820 --> 00:34:34.100
<i>The third round will be full team battles, 
 a battle of five on five.</i>

00:34:34.220 --> 00:34:36.690
<i>With the sixth player being the reserve, 
 he is able to be switched in manually during battle,</i>

00:34:36.830 --> 00:34:41.020
<i>The reserve will be switched in automatically,
 when a player is eliminated.</i>

00:34:42.820 --> 00:34:45.790
<i>The winner will be determined when one side is annihilated.</i>

00:34:53.090 --> 00:34:54.000
We won!

00:34:57.540 --> 00:34:59.940
<i>Excellent Era!
 They won four in a row,</i>

00:35:00.060 --> 00:35:02.280
<i>They are the most captivating team!
 The dark horse of this season!</i>

00:35:04.150 --> 00:35:06.610
<i>Impressively, this team consists of 
 only six early professionals.</i>

00:35:06.730 --> 00:35:08.170
<i>And no backup members!</i>

00:35:09.710 --> 00:35:11.330
<i>And the captain, One Autumn Leaf</i>

00:35:11.450 --> 00:35:13.670
<i>Holds the title of Glory's Number One.</i>

00:35:13.790 --> 00:35:15.680
<i>He is undefeated.</i>

00:35:20.510 --> 00:35:23.030
<i>But the player himself refuses 
 to show his face.</i>

00:35:23.150 --> 00:35:25.160
<i>A very mysterious player.</i>

00:35:34.000 --> 00:35:36.080
Why in the world does the captain never show who he is?

00:35:36.940 --> 00:35:39.550
Did he come from a scholarly family,
 like Butterfly Blue (the author)?

00:35:39.900 --> 00:35:41.540
Why would he hide that?

00:35:41.930 --> 00:35:44.280
Our captain must have some background.

00:35:44.550 --> 00:35:46.280
He couldn't be some 2G rich right?

00:35:47.230 --> 00:35:49.190
If he is from some rich family...

00:35:50.280 --> 00:35:52.470
Vice-captain, you should know something right?

00:35:52.590 --> 00:35:54.480
If he is then he better get some results,

00:35:54.600 --> 00:35:57.120
Or else, he could get dragged back into the family business!

00:35:59.380 --> 00:36:00.970
Captain Ye is captain Ye.

00:36:01.470 --> 00:36:03.590
You don't have to get me.

00:36:03.870 --> 00:36:06.080
We go to that hotpot place often, no?

00:36:07.150 --> 00:36:08.850
I'm not at ease,
 when you're by yourself.

00:36:09.610 --> 00:36:12.360
Hey, why didn't you come watch us? 
 We just beat Tiny Herb.

00:36:20.910 --> 00:36:22.050
I'm afraid.

00:36:26.740 --> 00:36:28.420
Mucheng, not that way.

00:36:33.250 --> 00:36:34.420
Dancing Rain...

00:36:35.620 --> 00:36:38.220
You carry it with you all the time?

00:36:38.640 --> 00:36:39.930
Yeah.

00:36:40.280 --> 00:36:42.180
It's the present that bro left me.

00:36:46.490 --> 00:36:48.830
Captain always wears a mask when he plays.

00:36:48.950 --> 00:36:51.080
Could he have something to hide?

00:36:51.200 --> 00:36:52.420
Oh, I know this one.

00:36:52.840 --> 00:36:53.860
You do?

00:36:55.180 --> 00:36:58.670
If he took off that mask during the fight then....

00:36:59.350 --> 00:37:00.940
The captain will…

00:37:03.280 --> 00:37:04.520
Talking about me?

00:37:06.780 --> 00:37:08.820
Sorry, We're a little late.

00:37:09.100 --> 00:37:10.350
Talking? N-Nothing important.

00:37:11.320 --> 00:37:13.360
Waiter!
 We want to add some dishes!

00:37:13.860 --> 00:37:16.160
Mucheng, you hungry? 
 What do you want to eat?

00:37:16.350 --> 00:37:17.510
Since everyone is here.

00:37:17.630 --> 00:37:19.570
For Excellent Era's future victories!

00:37:20.070 --> 00:37:21.280
Cheers!

00:37:24.120 --> 00:37:26.260
Captain Lü Liang, with all the matches.

00:37:26.380 --> 00:37:28.540
How do you feel about Glory as a game?

00:37:28.730 --> 00:37:29.920
Not bad.

00:37:30.040 --> 00:37:33.300
But it is not a game,
 it is a sports competition.

00:37:33.820 --> 00:37:35.660
For the Next match,
 Royal Style versus Excellent Era.

00:37:35.780 --> 00:37:37.160
Do you have anything to say captain Lü ?

00:37:37.710 --> 00:37:39.410
Excellent Era is truly strong.

00:37:40.120 --> 00:37:41.060
But,

00:37:41.790 --> 00:37:43.320
Royal Style is even stronger.

00:37:45.180 --> 00:37:48.010
<i>Here we see both teams have entered the ring.</i>

00:37:48.130 --> 00:37:50.140
<i>It is the first time these two teams fighting each other.</i>

00:37:50.260 --> 00:37:51.320
<i>Yes, the first!</i>

00:37:51.560 --> 00:37:54.240
<i>Finally these two favorites
 have met each other.</i>

00:37:54.490 --> 00:37:56.910
<i>These two teams are at the top 
 of the points leaderboards.</i>

00:37:57.260 --> 00:38:00.040
<i>This isn't just the first bout 
 between Excellent Era and Royal Style</i>

00:38:00.160 --> 00:38:03.140
<i>But also between two legendary characters,
 One Autumn Leaf and Peaceful Hermit.</i>

00:38:03.260 --> 00:38:04.740
<i>Yes, the players have exchanged handshakes.</i>

00:38:04.980 --> 00:38:07.730
- <i>The match will begin soon.</i>
- Greetings, Ye Qiu.

00:38:08.910 --> 00:38:10.950
Hello.
 I am Wu Xuefeng.

00:38:12.720 --> 00:38:14.020
Where's your captain then?

00:38:15.020 --> 00:38:17.640
Our captain usually sits there already.

00:38:21.410 --> 00:38:22.630
Eccentric.

00:38:28.880 --> 00:38:31.310
After the first two rounds,
 Royal Style is ahead.

00:38:31.430 --> 00:38:33.520
And the team match, 
 is approaching the turning point.

00:38:33.640 --> 00:38:35.820
Yes, each team has lost four players.

00:38:35.940 --> 00:38:38.030
<i>They are now entangled
 in a two versus two.</i>

00:38:38.230 --> 00:38:41.280
<i>Exactly, 
 with the two players left.</i>

00:38:41.470 --> 00:38:43.930
<i>One Autumn Leaf and Peaceful Hermit both don't have much health left.</i>

00:38:44.050 --> 00:38:46.510
<i>It seems that the outcome will be determined soon.</i>

00:38:49.970 --> 00:38:51.840
<i>He used the super armor on the Star Fall</i>

00:38:51.960 --> 00:38:54.280
<i>To cancel the knockback of my Falling Flower Palm.</i>

00:38:58.910 --> 00:39:00.780
Captain, I'm here to help!

00:39:04.070 --> 00:39:04.990
Total Darkness.

00:39:05.510 --> 00:39:08.440
<i>Total Darkness in the previous matches,
 tends to have high damage output.</i>

00:39:08.560 --> 00:39:10.300
- Excuse me...
- This seat is taken.

00:39:10.420 --> 00:39:13.450
<i>But today Royal Style
 is pressuring him.</i>

00:39:13.570 --> 00:39:15.530
<i>With both side's spectacular control,</i>

00:39:15.650 --> 00:39:17.060
<i>The battle is getting intense.</i>

00:39:17.180 --> 00:39:18.610
<i>With those four on the field.</i>

00:39:18.730 --> 00:39:20.640
Captain Han, who do you think will win?

00:39:20.880 --> 00:39:23.400
The key here,
 is between Peaceful Canoe and Total Darkness.

00:39:23.690 --> 00:39:26.290
Who ever can support their captain better.

00:39:30.100 --> 00:39:31.140
Don't drop your guard.

00:39:31.310 --> 00:39:34.660
This is an important moment.
 Find an opening for a coordinated attack.

00:39:40.600 --> 00:39:41.490
Nice equipment.

00:39:43.110 --> 00:39:45.450
This is my infallible partner,
 Evil Annihilation.

00:39:46.300 --> 00:39:47.950
Infallible still won't help you win.

00:40:05.010 --> 00:40:06.060
Sky Strike!

00:40:06.470 --> 00:40:10.140
<i>The v shaped Sky Strike hits its mark!</i>

00:40:10.400 --> 00:40:12.460
<i>If he can continue to control Peaceful Hermit,</i>

00:40:12.580 --> 00:40:14.910
<i>Royal Style will be forced to be defensive.</i>

00:40:15.420 --> 00:40:16.320
Captain!

00:40:16.440 --> 00:40:17.520
Where you looking?

00:40:21.030 --> 00:40:22.430
Your opponent is me!

00:40:23.340 --> 00:40:24.890
In a hurry to prove yourself I see.

00:40:26.090 --> 00:40:27.240
Don't need you to care!

00:40:36.850 --> 00:40:38.950
They somehow managed to CC each other at the same time!

00:40:39.070 --> 00:40:42.120
<i>With the health left of both captains,
 a single hit</i>

00:40:42.240 --> 00:40:44.310
<i>Can cause their elimination.</i>

00:40:44.810 --> 00:40:47.240
Total Darkness, last hit!
 Finish Peaceful Hermit!

00:40:53.600 --> 00:40:54.790
You overestimate him.

00:40:56.760 --> 00:40:58.370
You calculated this.

00:40:59.260 --> 00:41:01.010
Your plan is also the same,

00:41:01.350 --> 00:41:03.570
But too bad, 
 me and Peaceful Canoe have better synergy.

00:41:03.920 --> 00:41:04.790
Got them.

00:41:04.910 --> 00:41:07.320
My target was One Autumn Leaf.
 Didn't you realize that?

00:41:14.320 --> 00:41:17.030
<i>Defeat</i>

00:41:17.220 --> 00:41:20.830
<i>Between Excellent Era and Royal Style
 both teams gave it everything they got.</i>

00:41:20.950 --> 00:41:23.750
<i>Yes, in this match both sides played with fierceness and assertiveness.</i>

00:41:23.870 --> 00:41:28.210
<i>If during the last part Total Darkness
 didn't overstep the match might not be over yet.</i>

00:41:28.330 --> 00:41:30.060
<i>Yeah, what a match.</i>

00:41:30.180 --> 00:41:32.450
<i>Both teams made extraordinary plays.</i>

00:41:32.570 --> 00:41:35.490
<i>With that this match's MVP is Royal Style's Lu Liang!</i>

00:41:35.610 --> 00:41:38.880
<i>Peaceful Hermit, Lu Liang: MVP!</i>

00:41:52.650 --> 00:41:53.770
One Autumn Leaf?

00:41:54.050 --> 00:41:54.960
Peaceful Canoe?

00:41:56.210 --> 00:41:57.550
Call me Guo Mingyu.

00:41:58.270 --> 00:42:00.090
Didn't go to the post game interview?

00:42:01.040 --> 00:42:03.160
Not my thing, so didn't go.

00:42:03.810 --> 00:42:05.600
- You changed account?
- Yeah.

00:42:06.030 --> 00:42:08.710
The team went out of its way to invite Lu Liang.

00:42:08.830 --> 00:42:10.340
He didn't have his own Glory account.

00:42:10.650 --> 00:42:13.030
Peaceful Hermit worked well with him.
 So he can have it.

00:42:13.980 --> 00:42:16.520
Your weapon,
 you give him Death Savvy?

00:42:17.080 --> 00:42:20.160
Yeah. With the contract,
 the account belongs to the team.

00:42:21.210 --> 00:42:23.160
Since this is the beginning of Glory's league.

00:42:23.280 --> 00:42:24.820
Silver weapons are a rarity.

00:42:25.010 --> 00:42:27.220
Giving the strongest character to the strongest player.

00:42:27.340 --> 00:42:29.320
Only then, can it produce the strongest performance.

00:42:29.570 --> 00:42:31.910
To a team, victory comes first.

00:42:32.960 --> 00:42:33.970
Oh right,

00:42:34.380 --> 00:42:37.310
Total Darkness has potential.

00:42:37.660 --> 00:42:38.950
Bring him up well.

00:42:40.110 --> 00:42:41.380
Wait, he didn't tell you?

00:42:44.140 --> 00:42:46.110
He used to practice in Royal Style's training camp.

00:42:46.340 --> 00:42:48.870
But because he tried too hard to prove himself,

00:42:49.090 --> 00:42:50.460
he didn't manage to make the cut.

00:42:50.920 --> 00:42:53.290
I'm happy for him winning your approval.

00:42:53.750 --> 00:42:54.540
Mingyu,

00:42:55.640 --> 00:42:56.400
We're going.

00:43:10.180 --> 00:43:13.030
At that moment, I was thinking about eliminating Peaceful Canoe.

00:43:13.260 --> 00:43:15.710
And then fighting Peaceful Hermit together with the captain.

00:43:16.440 --> 00:43:20.250
Your positioning at that moment 
 doesn't allow you to be aware of the surrounding fight.

00:43:20.450 --> 00:43:23.230
You tunnel visioned! And lacked teamwork!

00:43:24.280 --> 00:43:27.010
If only you finished off Peaceful Hermit first...

00:43:27.240 --> 00:43:29.870
Yea, you have the high and sturdy APM

00:43:30.150 --> 00:43:32.910
It would be great to use this strength on teamwork.

00:43:33.800 --> 00:43:34.560
I...

00:43:35.590 --> 00:43:37.060
We could've won.

00:43:37.800 --> 00:43:38.550
Yes...

00:43:39.000 --> 00:43:42.320
I made the most errors,
 but going in head first is the only thing I'm good at.

00:43:42.840 --> 00:43:44.670
Enough with the excuses.

00:43:45.080 --> 00:43:47.270
If you're not good at teamwork then train it.

00:43:48.190 --> 00:43:51.450
It's not like I missed a training session!
 I need some time to become part of the team too.

00:43:51.680 --> 00:43:52.630
So what?

00:43:53.260 --> 00:43:55.620
I sometimes even suspect that you're a trojan horse Royal Style sent.

00:43:57.570 --> 00:43:58.670
What did you say!?

00:43:59.070 --> 00:44:00.430
Tell it to me clearly!

00:44:01.090 --> 00:44:04.530
It's not only me that got utterly destoryed by Royal Style.

00:44:04.770 --> 00:44:06.160
You guys did too!

00:44:06.640 --> 00:44:08.350
You say that I lack teamwork,

00:44:08.470 --> 00:44:10.370
but did you guys even back me up?

00:44:21.280 --> 00:44:22.630
Go back and rest.

00:44:23.810 --> 00:44:25.600
I'll wait here for you tomorrow.

00:44:39.110 --> 00:44:42.200
He resembles the past me.
 Thinking that he can win by himself.

00:44:42.920 --> 00:44:45.890
The lack of teamwork,
 is not his problem alone.

00:44:46.260 --> 00:44:47.990
It's because we focused too much about winning and losing,

00:44:48.110 --> 00:44:50.010
that we lost patience with our teammates.

00:44:50.350 --> 00:44:53.780
As the captain, for this failure I hold the most responsibility.

00:44:54.630 --> 00:44:56.620
Let us resume the review.

00:44:56.840 --> 00:45:00.990
<i>Excellent Era netcafe</i>

00:45:16.010 --> 00:45:18.150
It is late.
 How come you're still here?

00:45:19.690 --> 00:45:21.930
I saw the lights on,
 and came to check it out.

00:45:25.980 --> 00:45:27.330
I'm worried about Total Darkness.

00:45:29.530 --> 00:45:33.530
I know that for a captain the pressure is the most immense.

00:45:34.090 --> 00:45:36.460
But we're a team, don't forget about us.

00:45:37.490 --> 00:45:40.390
I understand you might have outside pressure as well.

00:45:42.070 --> 00:45:43.840
Since you already started taking steps,

00:45:43.960 --> 00:45:45.390
Is there a need to hesitate?

00:45:46.100 --> 00:45:46.990
Good night.

00:46:10.680 --> 00:46:13.030
<i>Ye Qiu, I bought us a new desk lamp.</i>

00:46:13.720 --> 00:46:16.460
<i>Remember to heat the food.</i>

00:46:32.720 --> 00:46:37.220
You think just by doing this,
 I would return to play?

00:46:38.050 --> 00:46:39.910
Nah, probably not that simple.

00:46:41.410 --> 00:46:45.390
At the start, all I wanted was to beat you and prove myself.

00:46:47.770 --> 00:46:49.890
But now if everyone thinks I'm not qualified,

00:46:50.010 --> 00:46:51.320
maybe I should just leave.

00:46:51.870 --> 00:46:53.450
Then why didn't you already?

00:46:54.180 --> 00:46:57.110
I'll at least wait until the league is over.
 I'm a responsible man.

00:46:57.670 --> 00:46:59.000
It's just responsibility?

00:46:59.120 --> 00:47:01.210
Of course I want to win too.
 Your turn.

00:47:03.560 --> 00:47:05.360
You won again?! This is the worse!

00:47:05.920 --> 00:47:07.380
I owe you a chocolate.

00:47:09.610 --> 00:47:11.490
I took more turns than you did.

00:47:11.610 --> 00:47:13.800
My chances of winning should've been higher.

00:47:14.720 --> 00:47:17.170
Wait, did you have plot armor?

00:47:17.290 --> 00:47:19.670
You were cooperating with me 
 and thats how I got the doll.

00:47:20.180 --> 00:47:21.230
cooperation?

00:47:21.430 --> 00:47:23.020
- I didn't help you.
- Let me.

00:47:23.660 --> 00:47:27.350
Every time you failed a try,
 you change the position of the doll.

00:47:28.200 --> 00:47:32.840
I wait for my opportunity,
 when the doll fall into the best position and strike.

00:47:34.450 --> 00:47:37.570
Without you, there was no way for me to get it in one try.

00:47:39.290 --> 00:47:40.530
Wow, won again!

00:47:40.650 --> 00:47:41.550
Ye Qiu,

00:47:42.830 --> 00:47:43.560
Come.

00:47:44.320 --> 00:47:46.080
Right now, Excellent Era is popular.

00:47:46.360 --> 00:47:49.220
See. A lot of pros want to join us.

00:47:50.120 --> 00:47:52.050
There is even a guy from Royal Style.

00:47:52.210 --> 00:47:53.330
You should choose

00:47:53.450 --> 00:47:55.500
The earlier you can get them to join the earlier we can work together.

00:47:55.620 --> 00:47:58.060
- I am not replacing Total Darkness.
- They are not replacements.

00:47:58.290 --> 00:48:00.380
We're in need of more personnel, and they act as backup members.

00:48:00.620 --> 00:48:02.540
It's normal to develop new blood.

00:48:02.800 --> 00:48:05.020
- He is like a bomb, just in case.

00:48:05.800 --> 00:48:06.950
Just in case?!

00:48:08.410 --> 00:48:09.710
There is no case!

00:48:10.410 --> 00:48:12.010
I'll quit right now.

00:48:12.680 --> 00:48:14.510
Go, find your sixth already!

00:48:23.200 --> 00:48:24.800
I understand your worried Brother Tao.

00:48:25.550 --> 00:48:27.670
Total Darkness is someone who refuses to lose.

00:48:28.000 --> 00:48:29.500
He is very capable.

00:48:29.730 --> 00:48:31.950
And our team needs people who refuse to lose.

00:48:34.360 --> 00:48:36.050
He might have some weaknesses yes,

00:48:36.630 --> 00:48:38.690
But I won't give up on him based on a single mistake.

00:48:48.870 --> 00:48:51.300
Ye Qiu, I'll follow your judgement.

00:48:51.690 --> 00:48:54.350
I'll put in a rest break for him.

00:48:54.550 --> 00:48:56.990
- Give me some time, I'll sort it out.
- Ok.

00:48:57.190 --> 00:48:59.730
Winter break approaches.
 Let everyone make adjustments.

00:49:02.370 --> 00:49:04.570
<i>Total Darkness really left?</i>

00:49:05.260 --> 00:49:07.240
<i>Just from one loss and some harsh words?</i>

00:49:08.520 --> 00:49:11.290
<i>I contacted him, no replies.</i>

00:49:11.910 --> 00:49:15.180
<i>For him, it isn't just one loss.</i>

00:49:17.090 --> 00:49:19.410
<i>That man used to belong to Royal Style.</i>

00:49:20.520 --> 00:49:22.330
<i>Even though he has the ability,</i>

00:49:22.720 --> 00:49:24.560
<i>Due to the lack of teamplay.</i>

00:49:24.950 --> 00:49:27.250
<i>Royal Style decided he isn't pro material.</i>

00:49:28.260 --> 00:49:31.740
<i>And that is why he tries so hard to prove himself.</i>

00:49:32.790 --> 00:49:35.960
<i>and why he is the most afraid to be abandoned by his teammates.</i>

00:49:36.450 --> 00:49:40.480
<i>We all fought together to get here, we have the synergy.</i>

00:49:41.290 --> 00:49:43.810
<i>Yes.
 All he needs is just some time...</i>

00:49:44.780 --> 00:49:46.780
<i>Let us be patient.</i>

00:50:03.710 --> 00:50:05.280
Didn't sleep well?

00:50:06.240 --> 00:50:08.100
Took a lot of time upgrading equipment.

00:50:09.660 --> 00:50:12.410
Is it the one bro made? Evil Annihilation?

00:50:13.250 --> 00:50:15.090
- Yeah.
- Is it strong?

00:50:15.800 --> 00:50:19.030
Your brother said it before, it is going to be the best.

00:50:20.070 --> 00:50:23.360
I'll come to watch the finals, is that ok?

00:50:23.890 --> 00:50:25.460
Make sure it doesn't affect your study.

00:50:26.360 --> 00:50:28.070
My big bro said that a lot too.

00:50:29.220 --> 00:50:30.580
I miss him.

00:50:34.190 --> 00:50:35.090
Me too.

00:50:36.900 --> 00:50:38.340
It's new years.

00:50:38.890 --> 00:50:40.310
Let's go holiday shopping.

00:52:17.680 --> 00:52:20.860
<i>I found in the netcafe, an expert with a home he can't return to.</i>

00:52:22.410 --> 00:52:24.360
<i>Bringing him home to PK!</i>

00:52:30.540 --> 00:52:32.840
<i>Going to supermarket to buy beddings,</i>

00:52:32.960 --> 00:52:35.490
<i>dinnerwares, cups,</i>

00:52:36.300 --> 00:52:37.390
<i>and a washbasin!</i>

00:52:42.020 --> 00:52:45.860
« Glory is not a game you play by yourself. »

00:52:57.840 --> 00:52:59.900
<i>After the recent semi-finals,</i>

00:53:00.020 --> 00:53:02.140
<i>Excellent Era and Royal Style
 have both advanced to the finals.</i>

00:53:02.260 --> 00:53:03.660
<i>Going past these six months,</i>

00:53:03.890 --> 00:53:06.450
<i>The masses will feast their eyes on season one Glory's</i>

00:53:06.590 --> 00:53:08.180
<i>First championship match.</i>

00:53:08.430 --> 00:53:11.060
<i>Excellent Era, the dark horse currently only have five known members.</i>

00:53:11.180 --> 00:53:14.110
<i>Will this stop them from winning the cup?</i>

00:53:27.660 --> 00:53:28.740
Same as always,

00:53:29.200 --> 00:53:30.470
Refusing to lose?

00:53:30.750 --> 00:53:32.800
If I don't stop, will you never stop?

00:53:34.320 --> 00:53:36.560
It is the other way around!

00:53:37.230 --> 00:53:39.280
I can't lose to you at everything!

00:53:40.110 --> 00:53:41.580
You can't outrun me.

00:53:41.940 --> 00:53:43.200
For this season,

00:53:43.350 --> 00:53:46.200
Su Muqiu and I started training ourselves since two years ago.

00:53:50.550 --> 00:53:52.070
You guys truly love

00:53:53.160 --> 00:53:54.280
Glory.

00:53:55.090 --> 00:53:56.150
Don't you?

00:54:05.440 --> 00:54:06.770
It's a draw.

00:54:07.140 --> 00:54:09.100
You said one day you'll beat me,

00:54:09.670 --> 00:54:12.240
But I know to you, winning the match is more important.

00:54:12.850 --> 00:54:15.360
Everyone is the same, they all want to win.

00:54:17.510 --> 00:54:20.720
All the way to the semi-finals,
 Excellent Era only had five players.

00:54:21.410 --> 00:54:24.250
What, are you sticking to only having five in the finals?

00:54:24.650 --> 00:54:25.860
We have six.

00:54:26.700 --> 00:54:29.050
Who is the sixth?
 Why doesn't he show himself?

00:54:29.680 --> 00:54:31.000
A secret weapon?

00:54:31.240 --> 00:54:32.450
Everyone is waiting for you.

00:54:34.230 --> 00:54:35.320
Me?

00:54:36.110 --> 00:54:38.100
I already put you on the member list for Excellent Era.

00:54:38.610 --> 00:54:40.910
Only you, no one else.

00:54:41.970 --> 00:54:45.490
I like to show off too much, and lack teamwork.

00:54:46.310 --> 00:54:48.780
In the team I am the weakest link.

00:54:48.900 --> 00:54:50.990
Is that Royal Style's conclusion,

00:54:51.180 --> 00:54:52.900
Or is it yours?

00:54:53.750 --> 00:54:55.910
Well it sure ain't Excellent Era's.

00:54:56.480 --> 00:54:57.280
I...

00:54:58.420 --> 00:55:00.720
What, giving up on becoming a champion?

00:55:01.240 --> 00:55:03.380
Giving up the chance to proving yourself?

00:55:04.330 --> 00:55:06.000
You believe in me that much?

00:55:06.780 --> 00:55:08.380
I believe in our Excellent Era.

00:55:09.420 --> 00:55:10.810
Just like I said as back then,

00:55:11.500 --> 00:55:13.400
When you finished resting, come back.

00:55:14.400 --> 00:55:16.940
I'll keep that sixth spot open for you.

00:55:36.920 --> 00:55:38.490
It's the finals!

00:55:39.120 --> 00:55:42.060
Total Darkness still not back yet!
 Doesn't he want to win?

00:55:44.760 --> 00:55:47.170
You think we are just going to give up 
 if he doesn't come back?

00:55:49.630 --> 00:55:52.360
It's the finals,
 Royal Style will surely come at us stronger.

00:55:53.770 --> 00:55:55.050
Seems like we'll lose.

00:55:55.980 --> 00:55:58.020
We lost when we had six players,

00:55:58.220 --> 00:55:59.970
Now with only five....

00:56:00.380 --> 00:56:01.640
We should wait a bit.

00:56:02.120 --> 00:56:04.580
- Maybe Total Darkness...
- You guys should believe in me.

00:56:05.580 --> 00:56:06.680
We can win.

00:56:08.210 --> 00:56:09.060
What's more,

00:56:10.080 --> 00:56:12.250
Our victory is guaranteed, we have a secret weapon.

00:56:13.550 --> 00:56:14.490
Seven!

00:56:14.850 --> 00:56:15.570
Six !

00:56:15.960 --> 00:56:16.660
Five!

00:56:16.970 --> 00:56:17.740
Four!

00:56:18.070 --> 00:56:18.820
Three!

00:56:19.180 --> 00:56:19.950
Two!

00:56:20.230 --> 00:56:21.280
One!

00:56:30.510 --> 00:56:34.570
<i>Tonight we shall put a period in our tales for this entire season.</i>

00:56:34.690 --> 00:56:38.030
<i>The one victorious shall be awarded with Glory's peak.</i>

00:56:38.270 --> 00:56:40.180
<i>And the ones fighting for it are:</i>

00:56:40.300 --> 00:56:43.340
<i>Those who stands above all, Royal Style!</i>

00:56:44.260 --> 00:56:46.150
<i>And their challengers,</i>

00:56:46.270 --> 00:56:48.200
<i>The absolute dark horse! Excellent Era!</i>

00:56:53.340 --> 00:56:55.030
<i>To every viewer who is watching,</i>

00:56:55.320 --> 00:56:58.080
<i>Excellent Era versus Royal Style, the fight for the peak</i>

00:56:58.420 --> 00:57:00.450
<i>Will commence!</i>

00:57:04.420 --> 00:57:07.340
<i>One Autumn Leaf leading the charge in singles round.</i>

00:57:12.970 --> 00:57:15.510
<i>Splendid, One Autumn Leaf's attacks clean and precise,</i>

00:57:15.630 --> 00:57:17.560
<i>Have won their team first blood.</i>

00:57:29.890 --> 00:57:31.160
<i>I miss my bro.</i>

00:57:34.740 --> 00:57:37.710
<i>Muqiu went out of his way and made this character for you.</i>

00:57:39.460 --> 00:57:41.000
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:57:42.920 --> 00:57:46.080
<i>Here lies, Dear brother Muqiu.</i>

00:57:49.580 --> 00:57:53.360
<i>Yes that's right. This is a present bro left me.</i>

00:57:54.450 --> 00:57:56.510
<i>I want to see bro becoming the champion!</i>

00:57:57.270 --> 00:57:59.990
<i>No problem, it is a promise. You will see it.</i>

00:58:02.200 --> 00:58:04.140
<i>I'll watch every match.</i>

00:58:05.780 --> 00:58:06.810
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:58:08.940 --> 00:58:10.300
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:58:17.880 --> 00:58:19.500
<i>Did you miss me?</i>

00:58:21.240 --> 00:58:22.570
<i>I'm always here.</i>

00:58:27.840 --> 00:58:29.490
<i>This gift, I love it.</i>

00:58:46.030 --> 00:58:47.030
<i>Don't be scared.</i>

00:58:47.690 --> 00:58:48.900
<i>We are a family.</i>

00:58:49.680 --> 00:58:51.090
<i>Everyone will wait for you.</i>

00:58:55.830 --> 00:58:58.570
<i>Next we shall be entering the second 1v1 battle.</i>

00:59:24.260 --> 00:59:27.260
<i>The sixth member of Excellent Era has not yet shown up,</i>

00:59:27.380 --> 00:59:29.210
<i>this fact seems to be applying pressure to the team.</i>

00:59:29.330 --> 00:59:32.470
<i>What do you think? 
-Under the fierce aggression of Royal Style's attacks,</i>

00:59:32.590 --> 00:59:34.940
<i>The players of Excellent Era are having trouble defending.</i>

00:59:35.060 --> 00:59:36.910
<i>They are having a difficult time already.</i>

00:59:37.120 --> 00:59:39.990
Lu Liang is in top form today,
 it is one sided this round.

00:59:40.250 --> 00:59:42.260
Excellent Era's sixth still didn't show up.

00:59:42.380 --> 00:59:46.800
On the final team fight, 
 I think they won't last even ten minutes.

00:59:46.920 --> 00:59:48.530
Yeah, it's over for them.

00:59:48.720 --> 00:59:50.320
<i>Half-time</i>

00:59:52.620 --> 00:59:54.120
Calm your breathing.

00:59:54.690 --> 00:59:56.530
Relax your body and hands.

01:00:00.090 --> 01:00:01.740
What, Royal Style scared you?

01:00:02.750 --> 01:00:04.040
Lu Liang is a monster.

01:00:04.260 --> 01:00:05.700
He is in top form today.

01:00:05.890 --> 01:00:09.040
Captain, didn't you say we have a secret weapon?

01:00:09.160 --> 01:00:11.280
- Shouldn't you bring it out?
- Thats right, Ye Qiu,

01:00:11.400 --> 01:00:12.920
What was the secret weapon?

01:00:13.040 --> 01:00:14.930
The secret weapon is every one of you.

01:00:15.600 --> 01:00:17.160
It is the strength we have together.

01:00:18.500 --> 01:00:21.020
Even though Total Darkness might be impatient 
 and he always want to prove himself,

01:00:21.580 --> 01:00:22.990
he never gave up on winning.

01:00:23.250 --> 01:00:25.450
In terms of never giving up he does it the best out of all of us.

01:00:29.280 --> 01:00:31.490
Zhi Ying, you might always be pessimistic,

01:00:32.220 --> 01:00:34.760
But I know I can depend on you in the critical moments.

01:00:35.570 --> 01:00:38.150
Fa Burong Qing,
 you might be foul-mouthed,

01:00:39.280 --> 01:00:42.100
But in truth you're thinking about our team.

01:00:43.820 --> 01:00:44.770
Cang Tian,

01:00:45.260 --> 01:00:48.090
I always wanted to thank you for what you did for Mucheng.

01:00:50.660 --> 01:00:51.550
Wu Xuefeng,

01:00:52.170 --> 01:00:53.640
with you as captain,

01:00:54.300 --> 01:00:56.070
Everyone can have peace of mind.

01:00:57.810 --> 01:01:00.950
Brother Tao, for us you gave everything you had.

01:01:01.960 --> 01:01:04.260
I am very thankful.

01:01:04.780 --> 01:01:06.230
Thank you for believing in me.

01:01:06.940 --> 01:01:10.480
Today with everyone here, we will take this championship!

01:01:11.260 --> 01:01:14.150
Captain, that's illegal.

01:01:14.270 --> 01:01:15.640
Really?

01:01:16.800 --> 01:01:20.130
Doesn't every shonen manga captain say something like this?

01:01:21.400 --> 01:01:23.870
Captain Ye, it doesn't suit you to say stuff like this.

01:01:24.270 --> 01:01:25.690
Ruins your image.

01:01:25.900 --> 01:01:27.410
To get to here from the first day,

01:01:27.670 --> 01:01:29.870
It took everyone believing in each other.

01:01:30.760 --> 01:01:32.570
Believing that family will come together.

01:01:36.240 --> 01:01:39.030
When we win, I'll agree to go out with you.

01:01:40.190 --> 01:01:41.350
Really?

01:01:41.470 --> 01:01:43.880
Emotion Magic, aren't you celebrating too early?

01:01:44.150 --> 01:01:45.380
Don't jinx me.

01:01:45.500 --> 01:01:46.690
Do our best.

01:01:47.580 --> 01:01:49.140
Half-time is almost over.

01:01:49.670 --> 01:01:50.770
Head out!

01:02:00.360 --> 01:02:02.120
We can be the champions.

01:02:03.050 --> 01:02:04.130
Do our best.

01:02:08.020 --> 01:02:09.750
<i>Welcome back, all of our viewers</i>

01:02:09.870 --> 01:02:12.780
<i>Soon the third round of this championship match 
 will begin, the team challenge.</i>

01:02:13.100 --> 01:02:16.440
<i>After this match, one team will be crowned champions.</i>

01:02:16.560 --> 01:02:20.110
<i>The stage of this match shall be our newest addition to the game:</i>

01:02:20.380 --> 01:02:21.840
<i>The Royal Library!</i>

01:02:22.180 --> 01:02:24.920
<i>Royal Style will spawn on the corner of 2F,</i>

01:02:25.040 --> 01:02:27.010
<i>Excellent Era will start on 1F.</i>

01:02:27.130 --> 01:02:29.660
<i>Let the match commence!</i>

01:02:36.000 --> 01:02:37.560
Arrived at center highground position.

01:02:37.760 --> 01:02:39.310
No sight of Excellent Era.

01:02:48.720 --> 01:02:50.680
To get to the second floor, there are only these two elevators.

01:02:51.230 --> 01:02:53.260
The one across from us is already boobytrapped.

01:03:01.670 --> 01:03:04.040
The two floors are connected by the elevators.

01:03:04.160 --> 01:03:06.750
Royal Style surely has already setup there.

01:03:06.870 --> 01:03:08.160
The main route is risky, but...

01:03:08.640 --> 01:03:11.120
They think they are in the shadows and we're in the light,

01:03:11.140 --> 01:03:12.530
But in truth, it's the reverse.

01:03:12.970 --> 01:03:15.400
Now that I think of it, this place sure is high.

01:03:16.420 --> 01:03:19.030
If we fall from here, we will surely die.

01:03:36.250 --> 01:03:38.530
Attention.
 Movement downstairs.

01:03:42.500 --> 01:03:43.570
What bravery.

01:03:43.920 --> 01:03:45.980
Just taking the elevator straight here.

01:03:55.710 --> 01:03:56.710
One Autumn Leaf!

01:03:59.310 --> 01:04:00.240
Over here.

01:04:08.500 --> 01:04:10.060
Oh, nice reaction.

01:04:10.990 --> 01:04:12.280
It's cause you were too slow.

01:04:16.350 --> 01:04:17.240
Focus fire!

01:04:20.930 --> 01:04:23.500
Looks like they took the bait!

01:04:50.010 --> 01:04:51.750
Captain, the pillars are begin to crack.

01:04:52.990 --> 01:04:54.160
Wait for my signal.

01:04:55.050 --> 01:04:56.520
From the way they're attacking,

01:04:56.640 --> 01:04:58.410
they shouldn't have caught on to our plan yet.

01:04:58.710 --> 01:04:59.630
Next,

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:01.690
We let them continue to destroy the surroundings.

01:05:03.930 --> 01:05:06.960
<i>Magnificent! One Autumn Leaf is somehow fighting four of them!</i>

01:05:07.080 --> 01:05:08.950
<i>His continuous use of clever movements,</i>

01:05:09.150 --> 01:05:13.150
<i>Led all the attacks coming at him hitting the surroundings instead.</i>

01:05:13.270 --> 01:05:15.310
<i>His control is leaving me breathless!</i>

01:05:16.910 --> 01:05:19.570
Captain, the pillar is almost at the limit. 
 Still not time yet?

01:05:20.050 --> 01:05:22.060
Wait a bit more, for that man.

01:05:25.110 --> 01:05:26.240
Captain!

01:05:30.560 --> 01:05:31.950
You're in a hurry.

01:05:32.500 --> 01:05:33.420
Captain?

01:05:33.750 --> 01:05:34.730
Now!

01:05:35.040 --> 01:05:35.980
Do it!

01:05:49.190 --> 01:05:50.440
I see...

01:05:51.390 --> 01:05:53.050
Is this what you've been up to,

01:05:53.590 --> 01:05:54.890
One Autumn Leaf?

01:05:55.810 --> 01:05:56.920
See you.

01:06:05.640 --> 01:06:06.860
The captain fell!

01:06:13.730 --> 01:06:15.410
You think you got me with just this?

01:06:19.590 --> 01:06:20.900
<i>Woah, One Autumn Leaf used himself as bait,</i>

01:06:21.020 --> 01:06:23.740
<i>and used Royal Style's attack to blow up that pathway.</i>

01:06:23.860 --> 01:06:25.830
<i>Right now both captains and their team are separated.</i>

01:06:25.950 --> 01:06:27.630
<i>My god, the battlefield is now split into two.</i>

01:06:27.750 --> 01:06:29.570
<i>Peaceful Hermit fell to the first floor!</i>

01:06:36.970 --> 01:06:38.280
<i>One is MIA.</i>

01:06:42.720 --> 01:06:45.110
<i>Right now there is combat on both of the floors.</i>

01:06:45.320 --> 01:06:47.790
<i>One Autumn Leaf is suppressing three members of Royal Style.</i>

01:06:47.910 --> 01:06:50.930
<i>And the captain of Royal Style is also surrounded by three!</i>

01:06:51.050 --> 01:06:53.910
<i>Both teams's strongest player are being put to test.</i>

01:06:58.700 --> 01:06:59.720
Secret weapon,

01:07:00.180 --> 01:07:01.410
activate.

01:07:11.030 --> 01:07:13.180
Little Peaceful Canoe stop hiding, come out and save your Cleric.

01:07:22.830 --> 01:07:26.170
This area is too exposed, 
 with that scythe in the way we can't get close.

01:07:27.390 --> 01:07:30.010
Go from the back route, that place has more complicated terrain.

01:07:31.250 --> 01:07:33.050
OK, I'll cover you.

01:07:33.660 --> 01:07:34.790
Blizzard!

01:07:43.460 --> 01:07:45.860
Want to use the terrain to fight guerilla warfare?

01:07:55.300 --> 01:07:57.040
This one versus three is too easy,

01:07:57.230 --> 01:07:59.960
Where's Peaceful Canoe?
 I'll take all four of you on.

01:08:25.430 --> 01:08:26.660
Total Darkness?!

01:08:31.280 --> 01:08:32.220
Caught ya!

01:08:32.660 --> 01:08:34.220
What? Total Darkness!?

01:08:34.340 --> 01:08:36.230
My god how did he appear here?

01:08:36.790 --> 01:08:40.600
<i>Total Darkness's sudden arrival 
 proved to be problematic for Royal Style .</i>

01:08:40.800 --> 01:08:43.250
<i>Not only that, Peaceful Hermit got himself CCed by Qi Breaker.</i>

01:08:43.370 --> 01:08:44.800
Excellent Era finally has all their members accounted for.

01:08:45.430 --> 01:08:46.910
Is this the start of their fully offensive team?

01:08:48.390 --> 01:08:50.730
We should start too, are you ready?

01:08:50.850 --> 01:08:52.460
<i>Now that Excellent Era have their full member count.</i>

01:08:52.580 --> 01:08:54.490
<i>Will this bring in new situations to the match?</i>

01:08:55.040 --> 01:08:56.300
Awaiting your orders.

01:09:02.680 --> 01:09:04.340
Careful! It's a trap!

01:09:08.390 --> 01:09:10.360
Flying Meteorite!

01:09:20.540 --> 01:09:22.140
Want to beat us?

01:09:22.260 --> 01:09:23.610
You still have a ways to go.

01:09:25.950 --> 01:09:28.990
Plan failed!
 Find a chance to switch in Woven Shadow.

01:09:30.010 --> 01:09:31.170
<i>Guo Mingyu.</i>

01:09:37.740 --> 01:09:41.950
<i>Doesn't it feel bad? Being in my shadow.</i>

01:09:42.690 --> 01:09:44.300
<i>Someone has to do it.</i>

01:09:44.920 --> 01:09:47.510
<i>Thanks to you, 
 I am the strongest shadow.</i>

01:09:48.350 --> 01:09:49.640
<i>Don't be foolish.</i>

01:09:50.620 --> 01:09:52.460
<i>I should be the one thanking you.</i>

01:09:53.670 --> 01:09:56.610
We will show you, 
 the true strength of Royal Style!

01:09:57.950 --> 01:09:59.900
<i>We can see here with the help of the Cleric,</i>

01:10:00.020 --> 01:10:02.060
<i>Royal Style is grinding away at Excellent Era's health.</i>

01:10:02.180 --> 01:10:04.860
<i>Looks like Royal Style is not letting their opponent 
 have a chance to switch in the Cleric.</i>

01:10:04.930 --> 01:10:07.350
<i>And on the side of One Autumn Leaf, those three are not letting him go.</i>

01:10:07.470 --> 01:10:08.910
<i>How is he going to escape?</i>

01:10:09.110 --> 01:10:12.470
I'm afraid if Excellent Era's Cleric doesn't come in soon,
 he won't have a chance to.

01:10:12.590 --> 01:10:14.310
You meant no need to, right?

01:10:19.980 --> 01:10:20.950
We're splitting up.

01:10:21.130 --> 01:10:23.350
Total Darkness, you and I will go support our captain.

01:10:24.810 --> 01:10:27.830
Spring Heaven, Emotionless Magic,
 go to the switch in area and grab Woven Shadows.

01:10:28.090 --> 01:10:28.980
Hurry!

01:10:41.860 --> 01:10:43.180
Star Fall!

01:11:11.440 --> 01:11:15.610
<i>What?! One Autumn Leaf's APM went up above 480!</i>

01:11:15.730 --> 01:11:17.010
<i>For regular players of Glory,</i>

01:11:17.130 --> 01:11:20.250
<i>any APM over 400 is already more than amazing.</i>

01:11:20.370 --> 01:11:22.740
<i>Not only that, pretty much all of it is effective actions!</i>

01:11:22.950 --> 01:11:25.570
<i>In a flash he has surpassed 50 hit combo.</i>

01:11:41.560 --> 01:11:44.820
<i>Right now One Autumn Leaf's hp and mana is looking worse for wear.</i>

01:11:59.760 --> 01:12:01.740
You think that with just you three you can beat me.

01:12:02.580 --> 01:12:05.730
In a match, only those with true strength succeed!

01:12:15.200 --> 01:12:17.150
Captain, what do we do?

01:12:18.530 --> 01:12:19.570
Captain!

01:12:34.550 --> 01:12:36.850
Why is he only chipping away at us using small moves?

01:12:37.210 --> 01:12:38.240
What is his goal?

01:12:38.490 --> 01:12:40.280
He wants to activate Battle Spirit.

01:12:41.910 --> 01:12:44.070
The 7th stage of Battle Spirit, in a pvp match!?

01:12:46.040 --> 01:12:47.510
If he actually succeeds,

01:12:48.240 --> 01:12:50.030
Who wins will be impossible to tell.

01:12:50.930 --> 01:12:52.180
Interrupt his combo!

01:13:02.260 --> 01:13:03.590
<i>One hundred and eight!</i>

01:13:04.050 --> 01:13:04.820
<i>One hundred and nine!</i>

01:13:07.680 --> 01:13:08.450
<i>One ten!</i>

01:13:13.030 --> 01:13:14.110
Oh no!

01:13:25.800 --> 01:13:26.920
March Rain!

01:13:36.980 --> 01:13:38.590
<i>A little bit more.</i>

01:14:09.060 --> 01:14:10.980
<i>What? A fire starts!</i>

01:14:11.100 --> 01:14:12.710
<i>Flash Memory , Royal Style's spitfire</i>

01:14:12.830 --> 01:14:15.130
<i>accidently activated the library's hidden feature.</i>

01:14:15.250 --> 01:14:17.110
<i>One Autumn Leaf failed to evade!</i>

01:14:17.370 --> 01:14:20.850
<i>He was only 10 hit away from the 7th stage Battle Spirits.</i>

01:14:20.970 --> 01:14:22.050
<i>What a shame!</i>

01:14:22.170 --> 01:14:23.570
<i>And with the library burning,</i>

01:14:23.690 --> 01:14:25.960
<i>It is only a matter of time until everything is burnt.</i>

01:14:26.080 --> 01:14:30.240
<i>Which leaves less and less space for both our teams.</i>

01:14:38.310 --> 01:14:39.730
<i>What are you doing?</i>

01:14:40.730 --> 01:14:41.910
<i>Fighting.</i>

01:14:43.570 --> 01:14:45.050
<i>What did you want?</i>

01:14:46.570 --> 01:14:47.480
<i>I...</i>

01:14:49.980 --> 01:14:50.950
<i>I'm here!</i>

01:14:51.390 --> 01:14:52.950
<i>I got my photo ID!</i>

01:14:53.840 --> 01:14:56.010
<i>I have you guys now, my family grows bigger again!</i>

01:14:58.120 --> 01:15:00.490
<i>Ye Qiu, what are you waiting for.</i>

01:15:00.970 --> 01:15:02.310
<i>Come sign the contract.</i>

01:15:03.950 --> 01:15:05.180
<i>What you hesitating for?</i>

01:15:06.200 --> 01:15:07.990
<i>Brother, you forgot this!</i>

01:15:14.860 --> 01:15:16.030
<i>I want to win!</i>

01:15:20.480 --> 01:15:21.840
<i>Everything ahead is on fire.</i>

01:15:22.440 --> 01:15:24.040
<i>And also there is that annoyance.</i>

01:15:24.850 --> 01:15:26.860
Look, One Autumn Leaf got out!

01:15:27.460 --> 01:15:28.760
Captain, you ok?

01:15:28.960 --> 01:15:30.520
Got bullied so hard you cried?

01:15:33.820 --> 01:15:35.310
Couldn't you see my health bar?

01:15:35.510 --> 01:15:36.910
Of course it hurts.

01:15:37.470 --> 01:15:39.330
Can't you just fight back?

01:15:40.480 --> 01:15:41.510
Rest assured.

01:15:42.000 --> 01:15:45.270
I'll get our revenge, for all of us too.

01:15:46.340 --> 01:15:48.160
Please be serious.

01:15:48.510 --> 01:15:49.840
You're making me nervous!

01:15:50.740 --> 01:15:52.750
Right, I have a plan.

01:15:53.040 --> 01:15:54.040
Very well!

01:15:59.650 --> 01:16:01.720
Cut away from Ye Qiu's face.

01:16:01.840 --> 01:16:02.660
Understood.

01:16:05.560 --> 01:16:07.170
What a piece of work.

01:16:07.290 --> 01:16:09.410
Good thing I brought control of the broadcast.

01:16:11.050 --> 01:16:13.680
Flash Memory, Gentle Angel,
 group up with the elevator.

01:16:24.470 --> 01:16:27.440
Qi Breaker, Total Darkness,
 cover me.

01:16:28.310 --> 01:16:30.900
We don't have much health left, avoid direct combat!

01:16:35.270 --> 01:16:37.800
Shoot!
 Flash Memory, Gentle Angel, get away from the elevator!

01:16:38.010 --> 01:16:39.480
One Autumn Leaf is coming for you!

01:16:42.420 --> 01:16:43.700
<i>What incredible APM!</i>

01:16:43.930 --> 01:16:46.950
<i>One Autumn Leaf is using the collapsed building 
 as his stepping stones.</i>

01:16:47.420 --> 01:16:49.530
<i>Over here we see Royal Style's striker,</i>

01:16:49.720 --> 01:16:51.700
<i>Hazardous Peaks has swapped in.</i>

01:16:52.000 --> 01:16:56.110
<i>Looks like the plan to switch in the Cleric will be difficult for Excellent Era.</i>

01:16:56.540 --> 01:16:58.410
Leave me.
 Go get Woven Shadow.

01:16:58.650 --> 01:16:59.880
- What about you?
- Just go!

01:17:19.390 --> 01:17:20.600
Total Darkness,

01:17:20.810 --> 01:17:22.200
Leaving it to you!

01:17:30.110 --> 01:17:32.240
Mingyu,
 go support Flash Memory,

01:17:32.710 --> 01:17:34.540
I'll find a chance to save Gentle.

01:17:50.180 --> 01:17:51.870
<i>The time is ticking.</i>

01:17:51.990 --> 01:17:54.790
<i>Does Excellent Era has no more chances?</i>

01:17:57.080 --> 01:17:59.820
Go Excellent Era!

01:18:01.690 --> 01:18:03.370
Excellent Era,

01:18:05.170 --> 01:18:07.280
don't give up!

01:18:11.790 --> 01:18:13.530
Excellent Era,

01:18:14.860 --> 01:18:16.450
can't lose!

01:18:17.440 --> 01:18:18.950
Go Excellent Era!

01:18:19.710 --> 01:18:21.290
Excellent Era,

01:18:21.610 --> 01:18:23.990
Go!

01:18:43.070 --> 01:18:45.500
- Captain, I'm finished here! 
 -Nice work!

01:18:49.650 --> 01:18:51.250
One hundred and seventeen.

01:18:51.760 --> 01:18:54.900
Total Darkness, Qi Breaker,
 wait for my signal and support me!

01:19:10.280 --> 01:19:12.180
Admit defeat! You're out of chances!

01:19:18.640 --> 01:19:19.740
<i>Heaven Sis...</i>

01:19:19.930 --> 01:19:23.410
<i>This play! Excellent Era's sharpshooter found her opportunity 
 and took out the opposing striker by self sacrifice!</i>

01:19:23.640 --> 01:19:25.280
<i>This allowed Excellent Era's Cleric to join in!</i>

01:19:25.400 --> 01:19:28.130
Emotion, bring Woven Shadow to our captain.

01:19:33.190 --> 01:19:36.060
Can't do it, this entire area is ablaze.

01:19:36.290 --> 01:19:37.680
We can't get over there Emotion.

01:19:37.800 --> 01:19:39.550
Follow me tightly.

01:19:42.510 --> 01:19:45.160
Emotion, this way of using magic shield eats away at your mp.

01:19:45.680 --> 01:19:46.890
It's making me feel bad.

01:19:47.160 --> 01:19:48.130
Emotion...

01:19:48.550 --> 01:19:51.810
Shut up! I told you before stop calling me that!

01:19:59.890 --> 01:20:01.780
One hundred and eighteen.

01:20:11.240 --> 01:20:12.250
Captain!

01:20:15.020 --> 01:20:16.430
One hundred and nineteen.

01:20:20.510 --> 01:20:21.650
One Autumn Leaf!

01:20:22.120 --> 01:20:24.070
Lu Liang, your next.

01:20:28.320 --> 01:20:29.300
I thank you.

01:20:43.560 --> 01:20:44.860
We won't make it.

01:20:57.440 --> 01:20:59.700
Do not look back, go to captain !

01:21:02.560 --> 01:21:03.340
Emotion!

01:21:06.600 --> 01:21:08.040
Cleric, I leave it to you...

01:21:15.500 --> 01:21:17.240
Don't bother with the qi master.

01:21:17.820 --> 01:21:20.790
Come quick, 1F will be engulfed in flame shortly.

01:21:21.140 --> 01:21:23.780
<i>We see Excellent Era's captain making a play!</i>

01:21:31.330 --> 01:21:33.250
<i>Is he refusing to give up on Battle Spirit?</i>

01:21:34.680 --> 01:21:35.930
Total Darkness!

01:21:41.400 --> 01:21:42.640
Captain!

01:21:49.290 --> 01:21:50.880
<i>You believe in me that much?</i>

01:21:53.570 --> 01:21:55.010
<i>I believe in our Excellent Era.</i>

01:22:01.590 --> 01:22:02.720
Captain!

01:22:06.990 --> 01:22:09.290
This APM...
 What a monster!

01:22:10.130 --> 01:22:11.630
He is coming, Lu Captain!

01:22:11.930 --> 01:22:13.380
Not that simple.

01:22:13.590 --> 01:22:14.490
Captain?

01:22:20.210 --> 01:22:22.010
Captain, I'm here.

01:22:27.340 --> 01:22:28.960
Captain, I'm here too.

01:22:41.360 --> 01:22:43.080
I will make this...

01:22:44.520 --> 01:22:45.480
Hit!

01:22:48.310 --> 01:22:49.740
One Autumn Leaf's attack!

01:22:50.470 --> 01:22:52.340
Not good!
 He is trying to knock us down.

01:22:52.820 --> 01:22:54.050
Let me!

01:22:56.280 --> 01:22:57.740
I won't let you!

01:23:00.730 --> 01:23:03.340
<i>All the sacrifice of his teammates,</i>

01:23:03.460 --> 01:23:05.670
<i>did it only bring him to a one versus one situation?</i>

01:23:08.460 --> 01:23:09.390
Captain...

01:23:10.240 --> 01:23:11.460
Leave it to me.

01:23:12.500 --> 01:23:13.590
<i>Wait!</i>

01:23:16.970 --> 01:23:18.900
<i>Stage 7th?
 That passive asks for 120 hit combo.</i>

01:23:19.020 --> 01:23:20.140
<i>Can you even do that??</i>

01:23:28.820 --> 01:23:31.690
<i>I got you,
 and the weapon you made for me..</i>

01:23:32.230 --> 01:23:33.680
<i>You tell me if I can.</i>

01:23:47.690 --> 01:23:49.240
<i>7th stage Battle Spirit!</i>

01:23:49.360 --> 01:23:51.800
<i>One Autumn Leaf he finished it!</i>

01:23:51.920 --> 01:23:54.840
<i>He actually did it! 
 He finished activating 7th stage Battle Spirit!</i>

01:24:00.550 --> 01:24:02.030
What a plan.

01:24:02.720 --> 01:24:04.290
Either both of us get knocked into the flames,

01:24:04.410 --> 01:24:06.280
Or that you finish 7th stage Battle Spirit.

01:24:07.210 --> 01:24:10.220
Your reputation of Glory's Number One precedes you, One Autumn Leaf.

01:24:12.750 --> 01:24:14.370
Not everything was calculated.

01:24:14.850 --> 01:24:17.860
I didn't think that Lu Captain would come accommodate me.

01:24:25.510 --> 01:24:27.880
Royal Style, do you fear losing?

01:24:32.300 --> 01:24:34.070
It's hard, I can't even lose!

01:24:35.070 --> 01:24:35.940
Come!

01:24:37.680 --> 01:24:40.230
<i>This match have been going for fifteen minutes.</i>

01:24:40.410 --> 01:24:42.690
<i>And the last battle is coming right up!</i>

01:27:46.750 --> 01:27:49.170
We both only have less than 2% mp left.

01:27:50.680 --> 01:27:52.510
I still have one exorcist skill left.

01:27:53.910 --> 01:27:55.930
It lets me extending the range of my basic attack.

01:27:58.010 --> 01:28:02.030
But you, you got no main class spell left.

01:28:03.930 --> 01:28:04.870
Soon,

01:28:05.570 --> 01:28:07.320
My weapon will surely reach you.

01:28:11.480 --> 01:28:12.230
Tell me,

01:28:13.840 --> 01:28:15.070
One Autumn Leaf!

01:28:17.030 --> 01:28:18.530
How can you even win?

01:28:28.880 --> 01:28:30.340
<i>What did you want?</i>

01:28:33.910 --> 01:28:35.340
<i>I want to win!</i>

01:28:38.020 --> 01:28:39.790
<i>We are only getting started.</i>

01:28:40.270 --> 01:28:43.400
<i>Advance to the summit, youngsters!</i>

01:28:44.450 --> 01:28:45.240
<i>Yeah.</i>

01:28:46.050 --> 01:28:47.910
<i>But we will be at the summit..</i>

01:29:08.860 --> 01:29:10.490
Captain Han, what happened?

01:29:11.490 --> 01:29:12.870
It's Rose Vines.

01:29:16.390 --> 01:29:21.400
It is not a skill from Battle Mage but the Enchantress,
 As a base class skill it have low damage and mp cost.

01:29:21.500 --> 01:29:22.100
But it also have brief CC.

01:29:22.110 --> 01:29:24.000
<i>I should've know, that you would keep this as gambit.</i>

01:29:29.620 --> 01:29:30.800
I see now,

01:29:31.860 --> 01:29:34.410
I can't believe you used a skill from another class.

01:29:44.240 --> 01:29:45.410
One Autumn Leaf...

01:29:47.070 --> 01:29:47.980
Interesting.

01:29:48.810 --> 01:29:50.170
Very interesting.

01:30:06.080 --> 01:30:07.280
<i>It Ends!</i>

01:30:07.690 --> 01:30:08.950
<i>Champion!</i>

01:30:09.150 --> 01:30:12.080
<i>It is the birth of Glory's first champion!</i>

01:30:12.360 --> 01:30:16.000
<i>Excellent Era is the champions! They did it!</i>

01:30:16.190 --> 01:30:19.190
<i>This moment they did it, this moment is for Excellent Era!</i>

01:30:19.310 --> 01:30:21.420
<i>Congratulations Excellent Era</i>

01:30:21.540 --> 01:30:24.830
<i>You're Glory's champions!</i>

01:30:39.950 --> 01:30:41.830
<i>The 24 carat trophy,</i>

01:30:42.840 --> 01:30:44.160
<i>we reached it.</i>

01:31:45.760 --> 01:31:48.270
<i>THE KING'S AVATAR
FOR THE GLORY</i>

01:31:48.270 --> 01:31:52.270
I wish you good luck.

01:31:48.270 --> 01:31:52.270
Butterfly Blue

01:31:55.240 --> 01:31:56.310
Marry me.

01:31:56.990 --> 01:31:59.650
Did you ask me out?
Did we go out?

01:32:04.790 --> 01:32:06.300
Going for marriage already.

01:32:06.890 --> 01:32:08.260
Look at you trying to steal bases.

01:32:12.530 --> 01:32:13.630
What do you mean?

01:32:14.530 --> 01:32:16.220
Oi, What do you mean?

01:32:18.070 --> 01:32:18.870
Boss.

01:32:20.300 --> 01:32:21.870
What do we do with the crane machines?

01:32:27.510 --> 01:32:28.510
Leave them there.

01:32:32.580 --> 01:32:34.410
Why do I have to run with you?

01:32:34.730 --> 01:32:36.100
It's the secret to a long life.

01:32:36.220 --> 01:32:37.450
If you can't fight, run.

01:32:37.650 --> 01:32:39.500
You deceived me into this!

01:32:40.790 --> 01:32:42.570
Slow down, stop here.

01:32:46.000 --> 01:32:47.800
Where you guys going?
 I'll bring you with me.

01:32:48.900 --> 01:32:50.180
- We're running.

01:32:50.300 --> 01:32:51.190
Don't fret!

01:32:52.670 --> 01:32:54.670
Vice-captain, bring me with you !

01:32:59.280 --> 01:33:00.590
I'm home!

01:33:04.600 --> 01:33:05.600
Oh, nice timing.

01:33:06.340 --> 01:33:07.180
Set the tables for dinner.

01:33:11.950 --> 01:33:13.110
Eh.... How's the taste

01:33:17.460 --> 01:33:19.410
I finally got them, skills for independence.

01:33:19.530 --> 01:33:21.900
- I can finally take care of you.
- I feel drunk...

01:33:22.870 --> 01:33:25.100
You put in too much alcohol...

01:37:27.680 --> 01:37:32.680
<i>The future, let our Glory carry on!</i>

01:37:32.880 --> 01:37:36.880
<i>Sous-titrage : Yarashii(fr)
Version anglaise : flycrane01	(This version by FlamyPow)</i>

01:37:38.000 --> 01:37:39.070
What about you?

01:37:42.390 --> 01:37:43.230
I'm doing fine.

01:37:44.480 --> 01:37:45.700
For us pros,

01:37:46.800 --> 01:37:48.330
We will all have to face that day.

01:37:49.300 --> 01:37:51.430
If it is inevitable,

01:37:52.940 --> 01:37:54.820
I'll give my time and my life.

01:38:03.610 --> 01:38:04.490
Ye Qiu.

01:38:05.100 --> 01:38:08.280
The team have decided to let our new blood Sun Xiang,

01:38:08.480 --> 01:38:10.070
take over as the new captain.

01:38:11.220 --> 01:38:14.850
One Autumn Leaf, will from now on belong to him.

01:38:28.480 --> 01:38:29.320
All of it...

01:38:30.110 --> 01:38:31.590
It's only going back to square one.
